1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,660
Why doesn't Aunt Jennifer tell anyone how old she is?
为什么詹妮弗姑母不告诉别人她有多大年纪？

2
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:19,210
Why doesn't Aunt Jennifer tell anyone how old she is?
为什么詹妮弗姑母不告诉别人她有多大年纪？

3
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:24,570
My aunt Jennifer is an actress.
我的姑母詹妮弗是个演员。

4
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:30,740
She must be at least thirty-five years old.
她至少也有35岁了。

5
00:00:31,830 --> 00:00:33,460
In spite of this,
尽管如此，

6
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:37,910
she often appears on the stage as a young girl.
她却常在舞台上扮演小姑娘。

7
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:42,950
Jennifer will have to take part in a new play soon.
詹妮弗很快又要参加一个新剧的演出。

8
00:00:43,470 --> 00:00:46,440
This time, she will be a girl of seventeen.
这一次，她将扮演一个17岁的少女。

9
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:54,790
In the play, she must appear in a bright red dress and long black stockings.
演出时她必须穿一件鲜红色的连衣裙和黑色的长筒袜。

10
00:00:55,810 --> 00:00:58,380
Last year in another play,
去年在演另一个剧时，

11
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:03,800
she had to wear short socks and a bright, orange-coloured dress.
她不得不穿短袜和一件色彩鲜艳的橘红色衣服。

12
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:08,750
If anyone ever asks her how old she is,
一旦有人问起她有多大年纪，

13
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:15,250
she always answers, 'Darling, it must be terrible to be grown up!'
她总是回答：“亲爱的，长成大人真可怕啊！”
